   <text:p text:style-name="P35"><text:span text:style-name="T30">Il prodotto </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T30"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr3" draw:name="Object6" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:y="-0.439cm" svg:width="0.889cm" svg:height="0.531cm" draw:z-index="36"><draw:object>
       <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block">
        <semantics>
         <mrow>
          <mi>Q</mi>
          <msup>
           <mi>K</mi>
           <mtext>T</mtext>
          </msup>
         </mrow>
         <annotation encoding="StarMath 5.0">Q K^{&quot;T&quot;}</annotation>
        </semantics>
       </math>
      </draw:object><draw:image>
       <office:binary-data>VkNMTVRGAQAxAAAAAAAAAAEAGwAAAAkAAAAAAAAAAAABAAAAAQAAAAEAAAABAAAAAfgBAAAt
        AQAAHQAAAJYAAQACAAAACQCLAAEAAgAAAP//gQABABAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAPcBAAAsAQAAiwAB
        AAIAAAAAGJUAAQAEAAAAAAAAAJYAAQACAAAACQCLAAEAAgAAAB8AigABAEgAAAAFAEIAAAAQ
        AExpYmVyYXRpb24gU2VyaWYAAAAAAADwAAAAAAAAAAAABQAAAAAAAgD/AwAAAAAAAAABAP8D
        AAAAAAAAAAAAAACIAAEAAgAAAAEAhwABAAUAAAD/////AIYAAQAEAAAAAAAAAHIAAgAXAAAA
        AAAAAPkAAAABAFGtAAAAAAABAAEAUQCMAAEAAAAAAIsAAQACAAAAHwCKAAEASAAAAAUAQgAA
        ABAATGliZXJhdGlvbiBTZXJpZgAAAAAAAPAAAAAAAAAAAAAFAAAAAAACAP8DAAAAAAAAAAEA
        /wMAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIgAAQACAAAAAQCHAAEABQAAAP////8AhgABAAQAAAAAAAAAcgACABcA
        AADdAAAA+QAAAAEAS6AAAAAAAAEAAQBLAIwAAQAAAAAAiwABAAIAAAAfAIoAAQBIAAAABQBC
        AAAAEABMaWJlcmF0aW9uIFNlcmlmAAAAAAAAkAAAAAAAAAAAAAUAAAAAAAAA/wMAAAAAAAAA
        AQD/AwAAAAAAAAAAAAAAiAABAAIAAAABAIcAAQAFAAAA/////wCGAAEABAAAAAAAAAByAAIA
        FwAAAJoBAACBAAAAAQBUWAAAAAAAAQABAFQAjAABAAAAAACMAAEAAAAAAIwAAQAAAAAA
       </office:binary-data>
      </draw:image>
     </draw:frame></text:span><text:span text:style-name="T30"><text:s/>misura la compatibilità tra i </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T31">token</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T30">; la funzione </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T29">softmax</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T30"> trasforma questi valori in pesi normalizzati; infine, i </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T31">value</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T30"> vengono combinati secondo tali pesi.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P3">Il <text:span text:style-name="T6">transformer</text:span> utilizza più <text:span text:style-name="Strong_20_Emphasis">teste di attenzione</text:span> in parallelo. Teste diverse possono contribuire a riconoscere relazioni differenti, per esempio collegamenti grammaticali, semantici, logici o tra parti distanti del testo.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P3"><text:span text:style-name="T6">L’output</text:span> delle diverse teste viene combinato e ulteriormente trasformato dagli strati successivi del modello. La rappresentazione di ogni <text:span text:style-name="T6">token</text:span> diventa così <text:span text:style-name="Strong_20_Emphasis">contestuale</text:span>: dipende non soltanto dal <text:span text:style-name="T6">token</text:span> stesso ma anche dagli altri presenti nel contesto.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc429_447025415"/>La <text:span text:style-name="T32">funzione di perdita</text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc429_447025415"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P36">La formula</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P37"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr3" draw:name="Object1" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:y="-0.406cm" svg:width="4.507cm" svg:height="0.522cm" draw:z-index="1"><draw:object>
      <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block">
       <semantics>
        <mrow>
         <mrow>
          <mi>L</mi>
          <mo stretchy="false">=</mo>
          <mrow>
           <mo stretchy="false">−</mo>
           <mi>log</mi>
          </mrow>
         </mrow>
         <mi>P</mi>
         <mrow>
          <mo fence="true" form="prefix" stretchy="true">(</mo>
          <mrow>
           <mtext>token corretto</mtext>
          </mrow>
          <mo fence="true" form="postfix" stretchy="true">)</mo>
         </mrow>
        </mrow>
        <annotation encoding="StarMath 5.0">L = - log P left( &quot;token corretto&quot; right)</annotation>
       </semantics>
      </math>
     </draw:object><draw:image>
