   <text:p text:style-name="P38">esprime la <text:span text:style-name="Strong_20_Emphasis">perdita</text:span>, cioè quanto la previsione del modello è stata sbagliata.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc431_447025415"/>Che cosa significa<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc431_447025415"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P38">Supponiamo che il testo sia:</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P39">La capitale d’Italia è …</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P38">e che il <text:span text:style-name="T6">token</text:span> corretto sia <text:span text:style-name="Strong_20_Emphasis">“Roma”</text:span>.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P38">Il modello assegna una probabilità a<text:span text:style-name="T33">d</text:span> ogni possibile <text:span text:style-name="T6">token</text:span>:</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P40"><text:span text:style-name="Source_20_Text">Roma <text:s text:c="6"/>0,80</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P40"><text:span text:style-name="Source_20_Text">Milano <text:s text:c="4"/>0,08</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P40"><text:span text:style-name="Source_20_Text">Torino <text:s text:c="4"/>0,04</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P40"><text:span text:style-name="Source_20_Text">Parigi <text:s text:c="4"/>0,01</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P40"><text:span text:style-name="Source_20_Text">...</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P38">La formula considera soltanto la probabilità assegnata al <text:span text:style-name="T6">token</text:span> corretto:</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P41"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr3" draw:name="Object8" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:y="-0.406cm" svg:width="2.706cm" svg:height="0.522cm" draw:z-index="8"><draw:object>
      <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block">
       <semantics>
        <mrow>
         <mi>P</mi>
         <mrow>
          <mrow>
           <mo fence="true" form="prefix" stretchy="true">(</mo>
           <mrow>
            <mtext>Roma</mtext>
           </mrow>
           <mo fence="true" form="postfix" stretchy="true">)</mo>
          </mrow>
          <mo stretchy="false">=</mo>
          <mn>0,80</mn>
         </mrow>
        </mrow>
        <annotation encoding="StarMath 5.0">P left( &quot;Roma&quot; right) = 0,80</annotation>
       </semantics>
      </math>
     </draw:object><draw:image>
