   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc435_447025415"/>Perché non si usa semplicemente (1-P)<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc435_447025415"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P38">Si potrebbe immaginare una perdita del tipo:</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P41"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr3" draw:name="Object14" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:y="-0.406cm" svg:width="4.138cm" svg:height="0.522cm" draw:z-index="14"><draw:object>
