       AAAAAAAAAACIAAEAAgAAAAEAhwABAAUAAAD/////AIYAAQAEAAAAAAAAAHIAAgAaAAAA4AEA
       AOYAAAABAAAAEiK/AAAAAAABAAEAEiKMAAEAAAAAAIsAAQACAAAAHwCKAAEASAAAAAUAQgAA
       ABAATGliZXJhdGlvbiBTZXJpZgAAAAAAAPAAAAAAAAAAAAAFAAAAAAACAP8DAAAAAAAAAAEA
       /wMAAAAAAAAAAAAAAIgAAQACAAAAAQCHAAEABQAAAP////8AhgABAAQAAAAAAAAAcgACABcA
       AACzAgAA5gAAAAEAUJMAAAAAAAEAAQBQAIwAAQAAAAAAiwABAAIAAAAfAIoAAQBCAAAABQA8
       AAAACgBPcGVuU3ltYm9sAAB3AAAA9QAAAP//AAAAAAUAAAAAAAAA/wMAAAAAAAAAAQD/AwAA
       AAAAdwAAAAAAiAABAAIAAAABAIcAAQAFAAAA/////wCGAAEABAAAAAAAAAByAAIAGgAAAGgD
       AADhAAAAAQAAACgAKAAAAAAAAQABACgAjAABAAAAAACLAAEAAgAAAB8AigABAEgAAAAFAEIA
       AAAQAExpYmVyYXRpb24gU2VyaWYAAAAAAADwAAAAAAAAAAAABQAAAAAAAAD/AwAAAAAAAAAB
       AP8DAAAAAAAAAAAAAACIAAEAAgAAAAEAhwABAAUAAAD/////AIYAAQAEAAAAAAAAAHIAAgA+
       AAAArQMAAOYAAAAOAHRva2VuIGNvcnJldHRvOwUAAAAADgAOAHQAbwBrAGUAbgAgAGMAbwBy
       AHIAZQB0AHQAbwCMAAEAAAAAAIsAAQACAAAAHwCKAAEAQgAAAAUAPAAAAAoAT3BlblN5bWJv
       bAAAdwAAAPUAAAD//wAAAAAFAAAAAAAAAP8DAAAAAAAAAAEA/wMAAAAAAHcAAAAAAIgAAQAC
       AAAAAQCHAAEABQAAAP////8AhgABAAQAAAAAAAAAcgACABoAAAD+CAAA4QAAAAEAAAApACgA
       AAAAAAEAAQApAIwAAQAAAAAAjAABAAAAAACMAAEAAAAAAA==
      </office:binary-data>
     </draw:image>
    </draw:frame></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P38">ma questa penalizzerebbe troppo poco gli errori gravi.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P38">Per esempio:</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P40"><text:span text:style-name="Source_20_Text">P = 0,1 <text:s/>→ <text:s/>1 - P = 0,9<text:tab/><text:tab/><text:tab/><text:tab/>P = 0,01 → <text:s/>1 - P = 0,99</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P38">Le due perdite sono molto simili, nonostante nel secondo caso il modello sia dieci volte meno sicuro del <text:span text:style-name="T6">token</text:span> corretto.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P38">Con il logaritmo:</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P40"><text:span text:style-name="Source_20_Text">P = 0,1 <text:s/>→ <text:s/>L ≈ 2,30<text:tab/><text:tab/><text:tab/><text:tab/>P = 0,01 → <text:s/>L ≈ 4,61</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P38">La differenza viene evidenziata molto meglio.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc437_447025415"/><text:soft-page-break/>Come si applica a un’intera frase<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc437_447025415"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P38">Durante l’addestramento, il modello non predice un solo <text:span text:style-name="T6">token</text:span>, ma tutti i <text:span text:style-name="T6">token</text:span> di una sequenza.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P38">Per esempio:</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P46"><text:span text:style-name="Source_20_Text">La | capitale | d&apos; | Italia | è | Roma</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P38">Per ogni posizione si calcola una perdita:</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P14"><draw:frame draw:style-name="fr3" draw:name="Object15" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:y="-0.409cm" svg:width="4.17cm" svg:height="0.593cm" draw:z-index="15"><draw:object>
      <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block">
       <semantics>
        <mrow>
         <mrow>
          <msub>
           <mi>L</mi>
           <mi>i</mi>
          </msub>
          <mo stretchy="false">=</mo>
          <mrow>
           <mo stretchy="false">−</mo>
           <mi>log</mi>
          </mrow>
         </mrow>
         <mi>P</mi>
         <mrow>
          <mo fence="true" form="prefix" stretchy="true">(</mo>
          <mrow>
           <mrow>
            <msub>
             <mi>t</mi>
             <mi>i</mi>
            </msub>
            <mo stretchy="false">|</mo>
            <mrow>
             <msub>
              <mi>t</mi>
              <mn>1</mn>
             </msub>
             <mi>,</mi>
             <mo stretchy="false">…</mo>
             <mi>,</mi>
             <msub>
              <mi>t</mi>
              <mrow>
               <mi>i</mi>
               <mo stretchy="false">−</mo>
               <mn>1</mn>
              </mrow>
             </msub>
            </mrow>
           </mrow>
          </mrow>
          <mo fence="true" form="postfix" stretchy="true">)</mo>
         </mrow>
        </mrow>
        <annotation encoding="StarMath 5.0">L_i = - log P left( t_i mline t_1, dotslow, t_{i-1} right)</annotation>
       </semantics>
      </math>
     </draw:object><draw:image>
