       AP8DAAAAAAAAAAAAAACIAAEAAgAAAAEAhwABAAUAAAD/////AIYAAQAEAAAAAAAAAHIAAgAX
       AAAAtAMAAOYAAAABAHh4AAAAAAABAAEAeACMAAEAAAAAAIsAAQACAAAAHwCKAAEAQgAAAAUA
       PAAAAAoAT3BlblN5bWJvbAAAdwAAAPUAAAD//wAAAAAFAAAAAAAAAP8DAAAAAAAAAAEA/wMA
       AAAAAHcAAAAAAIgAAQACAAAAAQCHAAEABQAAAP////8AhgABAAQAAAAAAAAAcgACABoAAABF
       BAAA4QAAAAEAAAApACgAAAAAAAEAAQApAIwAAQAAAAAAjAABAAAAAACMAAEAAAAAAA==
      </office:binary-data>
     </draw:image>
    </draw:frame></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P48">Questo permette alle informazioni di attraversare più facilmente molti strati e rende l’addestramento più stabile. La rete può quindi imparare non necessariamente una rappresentazione completamente nuova, ma una correzione della rappresentazione precedente.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P58" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1616_447025415"/>Normalizzazione<text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1616_447025415"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P48">I <text:span text:style-name="T48">t</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T6">ransformer</text:span> utilizzano anche tecniche di normalizzazione, come la <text:span text:style-name="Strong_20_Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T48">la</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Strong_20_Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6">yer </text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Strong_20_Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T48">n</text:span></text:span><text:span text:style-name="Strong_20_Emphasis"><text:span text:style-name="T6">ormalisation</text:span></text:span>.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P48">La normalizzazione mantiene i valori numerici entro intervalli più controllati e aiuta a stabilizzare l’addestramento. In modo molto semplificato, evita che le rappresentazioni diventino progressivamente troppo grandi, troppo piccole o sbilanciate passando attraverso numerosi strati.</text:p>
   <text:h text:style-name="P58" text:outline-level="3"><text:bookmark-start text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1618_447025415"/>La rete <text:span text:style-name="T6">feed-forward</text:span><text:bookmark-end text:name="__RefHeading___Toc1618_447025415"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="P48">Dopo l’<text:span text:style-name="T6">attention</text:span>, ogni <text:span text:style-name="T6">token</text:span> attraversa normalmente una piccola rete neurale <text:span text:style-name="T6">feed-forward</text:span>. Una forma semplificata è:</text:p>
